  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance for the elimination of controlled uses of Methyl Bromide (soil fumigation)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main impact expected from this project is to ensure a long-lasting sustainability to the MB phase-out by providing assistance for the elimination of controlled uses of Methyl Bromide (soil fumigation). The project will focus on two main areas of activity: Provide technical assistance to growers, identify gaps and lacks in the national legislation and provide the country with assistance in the legislation review.</narrative>
  </description>
